      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.27.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.27.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And after that they had mocked him, they took the robe off from him, and put his own raiment on him, and led him away to crucify ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.27.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.27.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And as they came out, they found a man of Cyrene, Simon by name: him they constrained to bear his cross.",
          "kind": "text"
