      "id": "MAT.27.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.27.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gave him vinegar to drink, mingled with gall: and when he had tasted ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it",
